Description: NexusOS Engineering Edition command-line toolkit
 The "nexus" command provides system information and read-only health
 checks, APT update and cleanup previews (privileged steps run only after
 explicit confirmation), FastAPI and React project scaffolding, cloud tool
 detection, Docker/KVM/libvirt status and local Ollama model listing.
 .
 Works on any Ubuntu-based system; NexusOS-specific details are shown when
 nexusos-branding is installed.
